[
  {
    "type": "opener",
    "page": "linear",
    "secnum": {
      "en": "SECTION 04",
      "zh": "第 04 节"
    },
    "h1": {
      "en": "Linear motion",
      "zh": "直线运动"
    },
    "lede": {
      "en": "PhysiClaw's X/Y motion is a CoreXY arrangement on three MGN9H rails. Two rails, one on the left and one on the right, form the Y axis. One rail spans between them as the X axis. Each of the two XY joints, where the X axis meets a Y rail, carries two idlers. Keep every carriage on its rail: a carriage that slides off spills its balls and is ruined.",
      "zh": "PhysiClaw 的 X/Y 运动采用 CoreXY 方案，由三根 MGN9H 导轨导向。左右两根导轨作 Y 轴，横跨其间的一根作 X 轴。X 轴与 Y 导轨相接的两处是 XY 连接件，每个连接件装两个惰轮。每个滑块都要留在导轨上：滑块滑出导轨，钢珠散落，滑块就报废。"
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "wide-top",
    "page": "linear_10",
    "head": {
      "title": {
        "en": "LINEAR MOTION",
        "zh": "直线运动"
      },
      "small": "linear_10"
    },
    "figures": [
      {
        "src": "linear_10_y_exploded_cam0_jwgq.svg"
      },
      {
        "src": "linear_10_y_assembled_cam0.svg"
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Install the carriage",
          "zh": "安装滑块"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Some carriages ship on a plastic dummy rail. Do not remove it first: the balls fall out. 1. Align the dummy rail with the end of the rail. 2. Slide the carriage across onto the rail.",
          "zh": "有些滑块出厂时套在塑料假轨上。不要先抽出假轨，否则钢珠掉出。1. 把假轨与导轨端面对齐。2. 把滑块推入导轨。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:16mm; top:30mm; width:80mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Build two Y rails",
          "zh": "组装两条 Y 导轨"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The Y axis uses two identical rails.",
          "zh": "Y 轴用两条相同的导轨。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:120mm; top:95mm; width:60mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Clean and grease the rails",
          "zh": "清洁导轨并涂润滑脂"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "MGN9H rails ship coated in anti-rust oil. Before you install the rail, wipe the oil off. Put fresh grease on the carriage so that it runs smoothly and lasts longer. Keep the rail away from water at all times.",
          "zh": "MGN9H 导轨出厂时涂有防锈油。安装前把防锈油擦净。再给滑块涂新的润滑脂，滑动更顺畅、更耐用。导轨任何时候都不要沾水。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:120mm; bottom:25mm; width:80mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Let the T-nuts hang",
          "zh": "先让 T 型螺母挂着"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "1. Thread an M3×10 FHCS into every other hole and let its drop-in T-nut hang on the screw tip. 2. Lower the whole rail onto the extrusion. 3. Tighten the screws to draw the T-nuts up snug.",
          "zh": "1. 每隔一个孔拧入一颗 M3×10 沉头螺栓，船形螺母挂在螺栓末端。2. 把导轨放入型材槽。3. 拧紧螺栓，把螺母拉起夹紧。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "right:16mm; top:80mm; width:74mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Mind the carriage",
          "zh": "当心滑块"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Keep the carriage on the rail. Do not swap carriages between rails.",
          "zh": "让滑块始终留在导轨上。不同导轨的滑块不要互换。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:16mm; top:90mm; width:60mm; display:flex; gap:4mm; align-items:flex-start;",
        "icon": "info"
      }
    ],
    "bom": {
      "label": {
        "en": "Bill of materials",
        "zh": "物料清单"
      },
      "rows": [
        {
          "component": {
            "en": "Linear rail",
            "zh": "直线导轨"
          },
          "spec": "MGN9H, 240 mm",
          "qty": "2"
        },
        {
