    },
    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Rail ends against the idler mounts",
          "zh": "导轨端面紧靠惰轮支座"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Adjust the idler mounts at the end away from the motors so that both Y rail ends sit tight against them.",
          "zh": "调整远离电机一侧的惰轮支座，使两条 Y 导轨的末端都紧靠支座。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "right:5mm; top:0mm; width:60mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Y rails: snug, not tight",
          "zh": "先固定 Y 导轨，暂不拧紧"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Tighten the screws of both Y rails until snug. Tighten them fully only after the X axis is installed and slides smoothly.",
          "zh": "两条 Y 导轨的螺栓只拧到贴合。等 X 轴装好、滑动顺畅后，再拧紧。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "right:16mm; top:120mm; width:80mm;"
      }
    ],
    "notesInside": true
  },
