      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Straight side toward the motor",
          "zh": "平直的一面朝向电机"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The left and right joints are mirrored. Install each joint with its straight side toward the motor.",
          "zh": "左右两个连接件互为镜像。安装时，平直的一面都朝向电机。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:150mm; top:120mm; width:80mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Tighten in a cross pattern",
          "zh": "按对角顺序拧紧"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "1. Thread all 4 screws in. 2. Tighten opposite corners in pairs. This pulls the joint flat against the carriage.",
          "zh": "1. 拧入四颗螺栓。2. 对角成对拧紧。这样连接件才能平贴滑块。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:100mm; top:30mm; width:80mm;"
      }
    ],
