      "style": "transform: translateX(-20mm);"
    },
    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Check the X beam",
          "zh": "检查 X 横梁"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Slide the X beam along the Y rails by hand. If it binds, realign the Y rails.",
          "zh": "用手沿 Y 导轨推动 X 横梁。如果横梁卡滞，就重新校正 Y 导轨。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "right:16mm; top:50mm; width:60mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Be patient",
          "zh": "需要耐心"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "1. Tighten a few of the Y rail screws until snug. 2. Slide the X beam and feel the resistance. 3. Nudge the Y rails and try again. 4. When the beam slides freely, tighten the Y rails from the center screw outward. This can take a few minutes.",
          "zh": "1. 把几颗 Y 导轨螺栓拧到贴合。2. 推动 X 横梁，感受阻力。3. 微调 Y 导轨，再试。4. 横梁顺畅后，把螺栓从中间向两端拧紧。可能要几分钟。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "right:16mm; top:100mm; width:60mm;"
      }
    ],
    "bom": {
      "label": {
        "en": "Bill of materials",
